## Why This Is Asked
This tests mastery of modern CSS techniques: container queries, grid/flex interplay, accessibility with keyboard navigation, CSS-only accordions, and motion preferences. It pushes beyond viewport-breakpoint thinking.

## Key Concepts
- CSS Grid with container-type/container queries
- Checkbox-based accordion (no JS)
- CSS transitions and staggered entrances
- prefers-reduced-motion and accessibility (focus-visible)
- CSS variables and theming

## Code Example
